  milestoneId: milestone_02
  displayName: Demand and Capacity
  description: Compare how quickly customers order with how quickly the process can produce items.
  completionDialogue:
  - You are matching station capacity to the flow. A fast station cannot help if
    the next step cannot take its output.
  - Systems engineering means balancing the whole line, people and equipment together.
    Keep the work moving at the rate customers need.
  isTutorial: 0
  minimumSystemEfficiencyPercent: 30
  minimumCustomersServedPercent: 55
